    {
        "id": "4e260a9ffc513bbc",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "AQ Meter Reading Submission",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Configure the database connection, existing JSON_QUEUE and ConsumerA subscriber, and Fusion server. Replace EXAMPLE_* values and ReadingDate with valid non-production data. Submit the queued meter reading first. Only the observed HTTP 400 AssetNumber validation error triggers an asset lookup; creation requires a successful empty items array with hasMore false. Other errors and existing assets are reported without creation. Duplicate Catch messages for one _msgid are suppressed for ten minutes (maximum 1000 entries); different submissions or deployments are not an exactly-once workflow. Asset numbers containing quotes, semicolons, backslashes or line breaks are not automatically recovered. Creation does not retry the reading or configure its meter association: verify the asset/meter setup before manually submitting again. Standalone dequeue commits removal before Fusion processing and does not restore messages on failure. Concurrent runs can race; use non-production resources for initial validation.",
        "env": []
